			(property "Description" "ADS1115 16-bit 4-channel I2C ADC breakout, 10-pin header. ADDR to GND/VDD/SDA/SCL = 0x48/0x49/0x4A/0x4B (VentSense uses 0x48, 0x49, 0x4B). Run at 3.3 V. Pin order follows the common module; check it against the board we receive before wiring."
