			(property "Description" "MQ-7 (CO) or MQ-8 (H2) gas sensor module with LM393 comparator, 5 V. AO up to about 5 V: divide 15k/22k before the ADS1115. DO unused. Heater about 150-172 mA. Pin order follows the common module; check it against the board we receive before wiring."
